\f0\i0 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::2><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Pastor Rex Humble stood at the makeshift pulpit in the showroom of what was once the Memphis Mafia Bar & Grill\'97now known as The Church of the New Gospel of Jesus of Memphis. A small evening congregation kneeled with heads bowed, awaiting The Collection of clipped sideburn whiskers. A new holy punch bowl sparkled on a card table by the pulpit, the original having shattered during an especially energetic exorcism of a convert\'92s sideburns. As luck would have it, Pastor Humble still had another half a dozen punch bowls in in his closet, all wedding gifts from decades ago. He held his Biblical Shears aloft\'97their orange handles the last remnants of colour in the solemn church\'97and was mid-benediction when he thought he heard the sound of singing coming up from the floor. He turned the organ music off that was   playing on his tablet and inclined his ear to the other, less reverent music\'97for certain some Evolution Elvi racket. He clenched his jaw and grimaced, supposed some backslider in the basement had tuned into the apostate festival stream on their tablet. Worse, they were singing along with it. Humble could not hear most of the words, he could guess the message from recurring syllables. 
\f2\i Religious minds\'85 religious minds\'85
\f1\i0  He began a sermon over the top of it without breaking stride, condemning the sin of corrupted music as if  sin was a thing you could catch in your homes if you left the windows open at night. \
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 In the second but last row of Humble\'92s congregation, an Elvine intoned words as if they were life and death to her. \'93We can\'92t go on as Elvi with religious minds.\'94 She got off her knees, went to the basement, and found a growing group around a small TV watching the High Elvis on live stream in the final song of the day.\
Upstairs, Pastor Humble preached on, certain, sweating and saved.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

